%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 500ef08f4cfac4121a17369cfd788261, type: 3}
  m_Name: CH1-LVL1-SCENE
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Ready for your Titan Assignment Day, Atlas?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: As ready as I'll ever be, Gaia.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: "Good. Remember, Atlas, your exercises are the key to controlling your
      Titan. It\u2019s best for you to try and feel it for yourself. Get in Hyperion
      and try out its controls."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: ' Focus on the forms, Atlas. The more accurately you perform, the better
      Hyperion will respond.  '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: (Hyperion lights up and mimics Atlas's movements)
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 3
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 3
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: That's it, Atlas. You did great! See how your movements were being mirrored
      by Hyperion?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: It... It really was responding to me!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: 'That''s the power of the Titans, Atlas. Your strength is their strength.
      Your speed, their speed. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Now, for the real test. Let's see if you can handle a swarm of rogue beasts.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 3
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 3
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: (Simulation starts. Atlas maneuvers Hyperion, defending against smaller
      rogue beasts.)
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: (Atlas successfully fends off the swarm)
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: " I felt it... The power of hyperion and my control over it as I performed
      these exercises\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: 'You did a great job atlas, you were focused and in control the whole time.
      I have never seen a rookie pilot this in sync with their Titan. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Your journey as a Titan Handler has truly begun. I expect great things
      from you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: I understand.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e33de4a91d1c40c8b01f97a04e983c8, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: I won't let Neo-Terra down, Gaia. I promise.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions: []
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e95011c0105bb4fe5ac448f6c4f799eb, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
